@TRPGHelper.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5080

### 健康检查
GET {{TRPGHelper.Api_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

### 规则系统
GET {{TRPGHelper.Api_HostAddress}}/api/systems
Accept: application/json

### 本地开发登录（Development，Auth:EnableDevLogin=true）
POST {{TRPGHelper.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/dev-login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nickName": "调查员"
}

### 用登录返回的 token 替换下面这行
@token = paste-token-here

### 卡库列表
GET {{TRPGHelper.Api_HostAddress}}/api/characters?status=all&page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 卡库统计
GET {{TRPGHelper.Api_HostAddress}}/api/characters/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 新建角色卡（不传 sheet.attributes 时按规则自动掷属性）
POST {{TRPGHelper.Api_HostAddress}}/api/characters
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "systemCode": "coc7",
  "name": "守夜人·林",
  "occupation": "记者",
  "age": 29,
  "summary": "追查一桩旧案的调查员"
}

### 状态流转：留卡
POST {{TRPGHelper.Api_HostAddress}}/api/characters/{id}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "retained",
  "note": "先留着，下次跑团用"
}

### 掷骰
POST {{TRPGHelper.Api_HostAddress}}/api/generator/roll
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "expression": "4d6kh3"
}

### 生成属性
POST {{TRPGHelper.Api_HostAddress}}/api/generator/attributes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "systemCode": "coc7",
  "method": "roll"
}

### 随机姓名 / 职业 / 灵感
GET {{TRPGHelper.Api_HostAddress}}/api/generator/names?systemCode=coc7&count=5
GET {{TRPGHelper.Api_HostAddress}}/api/generator/occupations?systemCode=coc7&count=3
GET {{TRPGHelper.Api_HostAddress}}/api/generator/inspirations?systemCode=coc7&count=3
